# HuggingFace cache and installs

Never write to `~/.cache/huggingface`. All Hub weights and datasets go to the Windows drive:

```
HF_HOME=/mnt/c/ml-cache/huggingface
HF_HUB_CACHE=/mnt/c/ml-cache/huggingface/hub
HF_DATASETS_CACHE=/mnt/c/ml-cache/huggingface/datasets
HF_HUB_DISABLE_SYMLINKS_WARNING=1
```

`src/embbench/core/config.py` hard-fails if `HF_HOME` is not under `/mnt/c`. Do not weaken that guard. Do not set these vars to a WSL ext4 path as a "faster" workaround.

Job outputs (`results/`), MTEB result cache, and Qdrant storage stay on WSL ext4.

Install only with `uv` into `.venv`. Never `pip install --user` or a global `pip install`.

```bash
uv sync
uv run embbench ...
```
